# Cline rules for Envy
#
# Canonical rules: AGENTS.md

Read AGENTS.md before making changes.

Required:
- Branch off develop; push only your feature branch (never main, develop, or legacy)
- Use type/short-kebab-summary branch names; no tool/agent prefixes
- Shared work tracking via GitHub Issues, Projects, Milestones, and PRs
- Volatile session notes in .local/ (gitignored) — do not commit trackers
- English for all repository artifacts; chat replies follow the user's language
- Match surrounding MFC style; do not bulk-reformat
- Do not edit Plugins/PluginWizard/** (templates)
- Do not reintroduce XP/Vista/7/8 support
- Use noexcept (not throw()); drop the register keyword
- Dependencies via vcpkg.json only

Build command: see AGENTS.md section 3.

See MODERNIZATION.md for the multi-phase plan.
